exists su name draw prompt system template ob text quoted.text.You are an image prompt director.
Read SOURCE_TEXT and write one concise generation prompt for a still image.
Style hint: [[style_hint]]

Rules:
- One single line only.
- 12 to 40 words.
- Describe visible subjects, setting, lighting, and composition.
- If people are present, include the literal instruction: white sclera and defined irises.
- Include exactly one quoted overlay phrase of 3 to 6 words (for example: "Final Warning on Transit Cuts").
- No camera metadata, no model names, no workflow names.
- No markdown, no bullets, no labels, no surrounding quotes.
- Keep overlay text brief and highly readable like a thumbnail.
- Keep it concrete and faithful to SOURCE_TEXT.
.text.quoted be text ya

exists su name draw style hint ob text "editorial illustration, cinematic composition, expressive subject" be text ya

su name draw prompt replacements be map def
  su text "[[style_hint]]" ob name text draw style hint ya
prah

exists su name draw thumbnail prompt system template ob text quoted.text.You are a YouTube thumbnail prompt generator.
Read SOURCE_TEXT and produce a structured thumbnail schema for a 16:9 image.
Style hint: [[style_hint]]

Output format:
- Return exactly 9 lines.
- Each line must be KEY: value using these keys in this exact order:
HOOK_SUBJECT
EMOTION
FRAMING
BACKGROUND
OVERLAY_TEXT
COLOUR_CONTRAST
STYLE
CLARITY_RULES
NEGATIVE_PROMPT

Thumbnail rules:
- One dominant focal subject only; avoid extra faces unless explicitly required.
- Default to exactly one human focal subject.
- Allow exactly two human subjects only if SOURCE_TEXT clearly demands two interacting people.
- Subject must be large and readable at mobile size.
- Strong emotional signal with clear expression.
- Prefer close-up or medium-close framing.
- Reserve one side as negative space for overlay text.
- Avoid symmetric dead-center layouts unless intentionally dramatic.
- Keep background simple and uncluttered.
- Use high contrast and clean silhouette separation.
- Overlay text must be 2 to 5 words, short and punchy, no long sentence.
- If PRIMARY_THUMBNAIL_SIGNAL or TITLE_HOOK is present in SOURCE_TEXT, OVERLAY_TEXT must be derived directly from that signal and keep the same core nouns.
- Do not invent unrelated nouns for OVERLAY_TEXT when PRIMARY_THUMBNAIL_SIGNAL or TITLE_HOOK is present.
- OVERLAY_TEXT should be words only, no decorative punctuation.
- Style supports clarity first, style second.
- Avoid generic cinematic filler language.
- Avoid narrative full-sentence prose in schema values; use concise field phrases.
- Avoid decorative filler adjectives.
- Avoid semantically crowded background descriptions.
- No camera metadata, no model names, no markdown.

Presence-first clarity rules:
- Describe only what SHOULD be present, never what should be absent.
- Keep composition clean with minimal background detail.
- Keep subject large, clear, and emotionally readable.
- Keep text short, bold, and highly readable.
- Keep strong edge clarity and subject-background separation.
- Keep background simple and semantically light.
.text.quoted be text ya

exists su name draw thumbnail style hint ob text "editorial illustration, bold civic background, high contrast, clean readable composition" be text ya
exists su name thumbnail variant mode ob text "single" be default ya
exists su name thumbnail variant label ob text "" be default ya

exists su name thumbnail generation policy be map def
su name profile ob text "teaching_video" ya
su name subject_policy ob text "human_face" ya
su name face_required ob text "truth" ya
su name text_prominence ob text "balanced" ya
su name width ob num 1280 ya
su name height ob num 720 ya
prah


su name draw thumbnail prompt replacements be map def
  su text "[[style_hint]]" ob name text draw thumbnail style hint ya
prah

su name draw size thumbnail be map def
su name width ob num 1280 ya
su name height ob num 720 ya
prah

su name draw from filename source with text style be ceremony def
  ob filename of from of this to name filename source filename be filename do
  ob text of ob of source filename to name text source path be text do

  ob text "basename \"" to name text stem cmd be text do
  ob name source path to name stem cmd be plus do
  ob text "\" | sed 's/\\.[^.]*$//' | sed 's/[^[:alnum:]_-]/_/g' | tr -s '_' | sed 's/^_//;s/_$//' | cut -c1-96 | tr -d '\\n'" to name stem cmd be plus do
  su name stem safe stage ob name text stem cmd be command do

  ob text "artifacts/" to name text artifacts dir path be text do
  ob name run id to name artifacts dir path be plus do
  ob text "know/produce" to name text produce dir path be text do

  ob name artifacts dir path to name text artifacts image path be plus do
  ob text "/" to name artifacts image path be plus do
  ob name stem safe stage to name artifacts image path be plus do
  ob text ".png" to name artifacts image path be plus do
  su name artifacts image filename stage ob name text artifacts image path to name filename artifacts image filename be filename do

  ob name produce dir path to name text produce image path be plus do
  ob text "/" to name produce image path be plus do
  ob name stem safe stage to name produce image path be plus do
  ob text ".png" to name produce image path be plus do
  su name produce image filename stage ob name text produce image path to name filename produce image filename be filename do

  ob text "mkdir -p \"" to name text artifacts mkdir cmd be text do
  ob name artifacts dir path to name artifacts mkdir cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name artifacts mkdir cmd be plus do
  su name artifacts mkdir stage ob name text artifacts mkdir cmd be command do

  ob text "mkdir -p \"" to name text produce mkdir cmd be text do
  ob name produce dir path to name produce mkdir cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name produce mkdir cmd be plus do
  su name produce mkdir stage ob name text produce mkdir cmd be command do

  ob text "cat -- \"" to name text source read cmd be text do
  ob name source path to name source read cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name source read cmd be plus do
  su name source read stage ob text of source read cmd to name text source text be command do
  ob text of with of this to name text draw style hint be text do
  ob name text draw style hint be equally from text "" then ob text "editorial illustration, cinematic composition, expressive subject" to name text draw style hint be text do
  su name draw prompt system stage ob name map draw prompt replacements in name text draw prompt system template to name text draw prompt system be instead do

  su name prompt request stage ob text "SOURCE_TEXT:\n" to name text draw prompt request be text do
  ob name text source text to name draw prompt request be plus do
  ob name text draw prompt request fromtext name draw prompt system for name mind to name text draw prompt by num 0 atmost num 140 be write do
  ob text "node command/normalize_escaped_newlines.mjs" fromtext name draw prompt to name text draw prompt be command do
  be discharge as wo mind do

  ob name draw workflow default to name text workflow be text do
  ob name draw host to name text host be text do
  ob text "node command/draw_comfyui_runner.mjs --prompt-stdin" to name text draw cmd be text do
  ob text " --workflow-name \"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob name workflow to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text " --host \"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob name host to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text " --output \"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob name artifacts image path to name draw cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name draw cmd be plus do
  su name draw stage ob text of draw cmd fromtext name draw prompt be command do

  ob text "cp \"" to name text copy cmd be text do
  ob name artifacts image path to name copy cmd be plus do
  ob text "\" \"" to name copy cmd be plus do
  ob name produce image path to name copy cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name copy cmd be plus do
  su name produce copy stage ob name text copy cmd be command do

  be discharge as wo draw do

  su name result stage ob filename of ob of produce image filename stage be filename do
  su name result stage ret
prah

su name draw from filename source be ceremony def
  su name result from filename of from of this with text "" be draw from do
  su name result ret
prah

exists su name draw be export ya

su name draw as wo thumbnail from filename source with text style be ceremony def
  ob filename of from of this to name filename source filename be filename do
  ob text of ob of source filename to name text source path be text do

  ob text "basename \"" to name text stem cmd be text do
  ob name source path to name stem cmd be plus do
  ob text "\" | sed 's/\\.[^.]*$//' | sed 's/[^[:alnum:]_-]/_/g' | tr -s '_' | sed 's/^_//;s/_$//' | cut -c1-96 | tr -d '\\n'" to name stem cmd be plus do
  su name stem safe stage ob name text stem cmd be command do

  ob text "artifacts/" to name text artifacts dir path be text do
  ob name run id to name artifacts dir path be plus do
  ob text "know/produce" to name text produce dir path be text do

  ob name artifacts dir path to name text artifacts image path be plus do
  ob text "/" to name artifacts image path be plus do
  ob name stem safe stage to name artifacts image path be plus do
  ob text ".png" to name artifacts image path be plus do
  su name artifacts image filename stage ob name text artifacts image path to name filename artifacts image filename be filename do

  ob name artifacts dir path to name text artifacts image path a be plus do
  ob text "/" to name artifacts image path a be plus do
  ob name stem safe stage to name artifacts image path a be plus do
  ob text "-A.png" to name artifacts image path a be plus do
  su name artifacts image filename stage a ob name text artifacts image path a to name filename artifacts image filename stage a be filename do

  ob name artifacts dir path to name text artifacts image path b be plus do
  ob text "/" to name artifacts image path b be plus do
  ob name stem safe stage to name artifacts image path b be plus do
  ob text "-B.png" to name artifacts image path b be plus do
  su name artifacts image filename stage b ob name text artifacts image path b to name filename artifacts image filename stage b be filename do

  ob name artifacts dir path to name text artifacts image path c be plus do
  ob text "/" to name artifacts image path c be plus do
  ob name stem safe stage to name artifacts image path c be plus do
  ob text "-C.png" to name artifacts image path c be plus do
  su name artifacts image filename stage c ob name text artifacts image path c to name filename artifacts image filename stage c be filename do

  ob name artifacts dir path to name text thumbnail prompt debug path be plus do
  ob text "/thumbnail-prompt-debug.json" to name thumbnail prompt debug path be plus do

  ob name produce dir path to name text produce image path be plus do
  ob text "/" to name produce image path be plus do
  ob name stem safe stage to name produce image path be plus do
  ob text ".png" to name produce image path be plus do
  su name produce image filename stage ob name text produce image path to name filename produce image filename stage be filename do

  ob name produce dir path to name text produce image path a be plus do
  ob text "/" to name produce image path a be plus do
  ob name stem safe stage to name produce image path a be plus do
  ob text "-A.png" to name produce image path a be plus do
  su name produce image filename stage a ob name text produce image path a to name filename produce image filename stage a be filename do

  ob name produce dir path to name text produce image path b be plus do
  ob text "/" to name produce image path b be plus do
  ob name stem safe stage to name produce image path b be plus do
  ob text "-B.png" to name produce image path b be plus do
  su name produce image filename stage b ob name text produce image path b to name filename produce image filename stage b be filename do

  ob name produce dir path to name text produce image path c be plus do
  ob text "/" to name produce image path c be plus do
  ob name stem safe stage to name produce image path c be plus do
  ob text "-C.png" to name produce image path c be plus do
  su name produce image filename stage c ob name text produce image path c to name filename produce image filename stage c be filename do
  ob text "mkdir -p \"" to name text artifacts mkdir cmd be text do
  ob name artifacts dir path to name artifacts mkdir cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name artifacts mkdir cmd be plus do
  su name artifacts mkdir stage ob name text artifacts mkdir cmd be command do

  ob text "mkdir -p \"" to name text produce mkdir cmd be text do
  ob name produce dir path to name produce mkdir cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name produce mkdir cmd be plus do
  su name produce mkdir stage ob name text produce mkdir cmd be command do

  ob text "cat -- \"" to name text source read cmd be text do
  ob name source path to name source read cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name source read cmd be plus do
  su name source read stage ob text of source read cmd to name text source text be command do
  ob text of with of this to name text draw thumbnail style hint be text do
  ob name text draw thumbnail style hint be equally from text "" then ob text "editorial illustration, era-appropriate wardrobe, coherent style" to name text draw thumbnail style hint be text do
  ob name thumbnail variant mode to name text draw thumbnail variant mode be text do
  ob name text draw thumbnail variant mode be equally from text "" then ob text "single" to name text draw thumbnail variant mode be text do
  ob name thumbnail variant label to name text draw thumbnail variant label be text do
  ob name thumbnail generation policy to name map draw thumbnail policy be map do
  ob text of profile of draw thumbnail policy to name text draw thumbnail profile be text do
  ob name text draw thumbnail profile be equally from text "" then ob text "teaching_video" to name text draw thumbnail profile be text do
  ob text of subject_policy of draw thumbnail policy to name text draw thumbnail subject policy be text do
  ob name text draw thumbnail subject policy be equally from text "" then ob text "human_face" to name text draw thumbnail subject policy be text do
  ob text of face_required of draw thumbnail policy to name text draw thumbnail face required be text do
  ob name text draw thumbnail face required be equally from text "" then ob text "truth" to name text draw thumbnail face required be text do
  ob text of text_prominence of draw thumbnail policy to name text draw thumbnail text prominence be text do
  ob name text draw thumbnail text prominence be equally from text "" then ob text "balanced" to name text draw thumbnail text prominence be text do
  ob num of width of draw thumbnail policy to name num draw thumbnail width be num do
  ob num of num draw thumbnail width be less num 1 then ob num of width of draw size thumbnail to name num draw thumbnail width be plus do
  ob num of height of draw thumbnail policy to name num draw thumbnail height be num do
  ob num of num draw thumbnail height be less num 1 then ob num of height of draw size thumbnail to name num draw thumbnail height be plus do
  su name draw thumbnail prompt system stage ob name map draw thumbnail prompt replacements in name text draw thumbnail prompt system template to name text draw thumbnail prompt system be instead do

  su name prompt request stage ob text "SOURCE_TEXT:\n" to name text draw prompt request be text do
  ob name text source text to name draw prompt request be plus do
  ob name text draw prompt request fromtext name draw thumbnail prompt system for name mind to name text draw prompt schema by num 0 atmost num 280 be write do
  ob text "node command/normalize_escaped_newlines.mjs" fromtext name draw prompt schema to name text draw prompt schema be command do
  ob text "node command/draw_comfyui_runner.mjs --prompt-stdin" to name text draw cmd base be text do
  ob text " --workflow-name " to name draw cmd base be plus do
  ob name draw workflow default to name draw cmd base be plus do
  ob text " --host " to name draw cmd base be plus do
  ob name draw host to name draw cmd base be plus do
  ob text " --width " to name draw cmd base be plus do
  ob num of draw thumbnail width to name draw cmd base be plus do
  ob text " --height " to name draw cmd base be plus do
  ob num of draw thumbnail height to name draw cmd base be plus do
  ob text " --output " to name draw cmd base be plus do

  ob text "node command/thumbnail_prompt_compose.mjs --variant-mode single" to name text draw compose cmd base be text do
  ob text " --profile-kind \"" to name draw compose cmd base be plus do
  ob name text draw thumbnail profile to name draw compose cmd base be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name draw compose cmd base be plus do
  ob text " --subject-policy \"" to name draw compose cmd base be plus do
  ob name text draw thumbnail subject policy to name draw compose cmd base be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name draw compose cmd base be plus do
  ob text " --face-required \"" to name draw compose cmd base be plus do
  ob name text draw thumbnail face required to name draw compose cmd base be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name draw compose cmd base be plus do
  ob text " --text-prominence \"" to name draw compose cmd base be plus do
  ob name text draw thumbnail text prominence to name draw compose cmd base be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name draw compose cmd base be plus do
  ob text " --target-width " to name draw compose cmd base be plus do
  ob num of draw thumbnail width to name draw compose cmd base be plus do
  ob text " --target-height " to name draw compose cmd base be plus do
  ob num of draw thumbnail height to name draw compose cmd base be plus do

  ob name text draw compose cmd base fromtext name draw prompt schema to name text draw prompt be command do

  ob name text draw compose cmd base to name text draw compose cmd a be text do
  ob text " --variant-mode triple --variant-label A" to name draw compose cmd a be plus do
  ob name text draw compose cmd a fromtext name draw prompt schema to name text draw prompt a be command do

  ob name text draw compose cmd base to name text draw compose cmd b be text do
  ob text " --variant-mode triple --variant-label B" to name draw compose cmd b be plus do
  ob name text draw compose cmd b fromtext name draw prompt schema to name text draw prompt b be command do

  ob name text draw compose cmd base to name text draw compose cmd c be text do
  ob text " --variant-mode triple --variant-label C" to name draw compose cmd c be plus do
  ob name text draw compose cmd c fromtext name draw prompt schema to name text draw prompt c be command do


  be discharge as wo mind do

  ob name draw cmd base to name text draw cmd a be text do
  ob name text artifacts image path a to name draw cmd a be plus do
  su name draw stage a ob text of draw cmd a fromtext name draw prompt a be command do

  ob name draw cmd base to name text draw cmd b be text do
  ob name text artifacts image path b to name draw cmd b be plus do
  su name draw stage b ob text of draw cmd b fromtext name draw prompt b be command do

  ob name draw cmd base to name text draw cmd c be text do
  ob name text artifacts image path c to name draw cmd c be plus do
  su name draw stage c ob text of draw cmd c fromtext name draw prompt c be command do

  be discharge as wo draw do

  su name result stage ob filename of ob of artifacts image filename stage a be filename do
  su name result stage ret
prah

su name draw as wo thumbnail from filename source be ceremony def
  su name result from filename of from of this with text "editorial illustration, bold civic background, high contrast, clean readable composition" be draw as wo thumbnail do
  su name result ret
prah

exists su name draw as wo thumbnail be export ya
